message: "If you use FluxV2X in research, benchmarking, or security evaluations, please cite the software as follows."
title: "FluxV2X: Context-Aware Network Security and Experimentation Platform"
abstract: "FluxV2X is an extensible data engineering and network security platform for structured-data analysis, contextual anomaly detection, reproducible machine-learning experiments, vehicular communication security, and offline defensive-policy evaluation."
